The '''Highlands''' were an area of the planet [[Zygerria/Legends|Zygerria]]. During the [[Clone Wars/Legends|Clone Wars]], at the [[Time/Legends|time]] of a [[Jedi/Legends|Jedi]] [[Mission to Zygerria/Legends|mission]] to Zygerria, a [[Zygerrian News/Legends|Zygerrian News]] weather report mentioned the possibility of thunderstorms in the Highlands.<ref name="Trivia Gallery">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/escape-from-kadavo-trivia-gallery|text="Escape from Kadavo" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 5}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
In "[[Escape from Kadavo]]," the thirteenth episode in the [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]] of ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'', a [[Zygerrian News]] report written in [[Aurebesh]], which mentions the Highlands, can be spotted in the throne room of the [[Royal Palace of Zygerria/Legends|Zygerrian Royal Palace]]. However, it is too far away to read in the final episode.<ref name="Escape from Kadavo">{{TCW|Escape from Kadavo}}</ref>

